                                        "entry_id": "896740bc-5fe5-381f-8a99-22e2b3a24cb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "große, menschengestaltige, zeitweise zum Leben erwachende, künstlich geschaffene Tonfigur"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "443bc3dc-889a-4e63-bd70-b605709f29c0",
                                                "sense_id": "e7f8d8ac-6c7c-3299-9199-2db6f71ffda9",
                                                "text": "„Kinder wurden mit Geschichten über Dibbuks und Golems erschreckt, Heiraten wurden arrangiert und niedere Impulse rigoros unterdrückt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4bc4b65c-6a8e-43de-83c2-836916ea2ccf",
                        "source_entry_id": "6c08d266-27dc-3aa4-be8c-ce229f3e6368",
                        "target_lang_word": "golem",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "golem",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a12b3eb4-210c-3a5e-b4b8-e7c869a12755",
                                        "entry_id": "b0ffa2db-6158-335f-af12-102588de6a97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A humanoid creature made from clay, animated by magic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81df8c63-2a1d-3c80-9a4a-8c865bde583c",
                                        "entry_id": "b0ffa2db-6158-335f-af12-102588de6a97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A humanoid creature made from any previously inanimate matter, such as wood or stone, animated by magic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40632181-4f7a-4a0f-86ba-a1ddcd5fc52a",
                                                "sense_id": "81df8c63-2a1d-3c80-9a4a-8c865bde583c",
                                                "text": "She is elected mayor through the help of a golem she creates out of the soil of the potted plants she keeps in her apartment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bd308da-ca27-42ef-aad9-adcba3facbd2",
                                                "sense_id": "81df8c63-2a1d-3c80-9a4a-8c865bde583c",
                                                "text": "“There was also stuff that we actually had to take out which would have ruined the plot of the movie,” he said of his favorite details. “Getting the angry old man in there was very important, and the woodland mansion. But also things like the iron golems turned out so well.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b6566d90-78a3-488d-bd5f-4fdebf6eaa08",
                        "source_entry_id": "6c08d266-27dc-3aa4-be8c-ce229f3e6368",
                        "target_lang_word": "golem",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "golem",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7caa6117-99cc-3630-b012-2ae536c8dccd",
                                        "entry_id": "b02c4bad-4739-38d9-815d-895bf3072d57",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Criatura legendaria, similar a un hombre, que según las tradiciones cabalísticas podía ser moldeada de arcilla por los sabios rabinos. Imperfectos, como sus creadores, carecían de la facultad del habla."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53539696-7b9d-41c5-8c18-614fce88da38",
                                                "sense_id": "7caa6117-99cc-3630-b012-2ae536c8dccd",
                                                "text": "El rabí lo miraba con ternura\ny con algún horror. '¿Cómo' (se dijo)\n'pude engendrar este penoso hijo\ny la inacción dejé, que es la cordura?' // '¿Por qué di en agregar a la infinita\nserie un símbolo más? ¿Por qué a la vana\nmadeja que en lo eterno se\ndevana,\ndi otra causa, otro efecto y otra cuita?' // En la hora de angustia y de luz vaga,\nen su Golem los ojos detenía.\n¿Quién nos dirá las cosas que sentía\nDios, al mirar a su rabino en Praga?"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
